# ── Secrets & local machine config (NEVER commit) ─────────────
# THIS REPO IS PUBLIC. Anything committed here is world-readable within
# seconds — bots scrape public GitHub for credentials continuously. The only
# secrets this project uses (RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET, SANITY_WRITE_TOKEN) belong
# in Netlify environment variables and must never appear in a file.
.claude/                 # contains a Sanity Editor token in settings.local.json

# every .env variant, anywhere in the tree, except the checked-in template
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
!**/.env.example

# key material and credential dumps, whatever they get named
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.keystore
secrets.json
credentials.json
service-account*.json

# ── Dependencies ──────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
studio/node_modules/

# ── Netlify local state & build output ────────────────────────
.netlify
dist/

# ── Sanity Studio build output ────────────────────────────────
studio/dist/

# ── One-time import artifact (3 MB base64 dump; data already lives in Sanity) ──
studio/seed/

# ── OS / editor junk ──────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
